                                                "sense_id": "1626a983-4551-3a90-bb54-0152d3d328e8",
                                                "text": "Efficient measures have been taken to combine with the native cultural elements. Further, walkways and guardrails are also constructed along the bikeway that has been planned by the county government in order to magnify the sightseeing momentum for Chutien Township."
